{"unit_id":"tag:0AHF:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设\n<MATH_0002>\n为<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）的交换图（commutative diagram）。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004>是满射的（surjective）、平坦的（flat）且局部有限呈示的（locally of finite presentation），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0005>是句法的（syntomic）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则<MATH_0006>和<MATH_0007>都是句法的（syntomic）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示的"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法的"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"本句的基底对象；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"交换图的对象；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"交换图中的箭头；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"给定图的交换性；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"态射性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的","context":"态射性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示的","context":"态射性质；词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法的","context":"本引理的态射性质，暂用译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
